@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title DineFlow - Booking and Reservation
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
hide empty members

top to bottom direction
class Customer {
 userId: Identifier
}
class Restaurant {
 restaurantId: Identifier
}
class FloorPlan {
 planId: Identifier
}
class RestaurantTable {
 tableId: Identifier
 capacity: Integer
}
class Reservation {
 reservationId: Identifier
 start: DateTime
 end: DateTime
 guestCount: Integer
 status: ReservationStatus
 deliveryStatus: DeliveryStatus
}
enum ReservationStatus {
 CONFIRMED
 CANCELLED
 EXPIRED
}
class BookingService <<application service>> {
 +checkAvailability(tableId, start, end, guestCount): AvailabilityResult
 +createBooking(customerId, tableId, start, end, guestCount): BookingResult
 +changeReservation(reservationId, newStart, newEnd): BookingResult
 +cancelReservation(reservationId)
 +expireReservation(reservationId)
 +recordDelivery(reference, result)
}
interface BookingAuthority {
 +checkAvailability(tableId, start, end, guestCount): AvailabilityResult
 +createIfAvailable(customerId, tableId, start, end, guestCount): BookingResult
}
interface POSIntegration {
 +deliverConfirmed(reference): DeliveryResult
}
Customer "1" -- "0..*" Reservation
Restaurant "1" -- "1" FloorPlan
Restaurant "1" -- "1..*" RestaurantTable
FloorPlan "1" -- "1..*" RestaurantTable : displays
RestaurantTable "1" -- "0..*" Reservation
BookingService ..> BookingAuthority : delegates atomic decision
BookingService ..> Reservation : coordinates
BookingService ..> POSIntegration : confirmed handoff
Reservation ..> ReservationStatus
note right of BookingAuthority
One coordinated authority across booking channels.
Implementation and source of truth TBD (D-02).
Preview does not reserve a table.
end note
note bottom of ReservationStatus
P-BOOK: create CONFIRMED independently of payment.
P-BOOK: expiry at booked end; cancellation policy TBD.
P-INTEGRATION: delivery is tracked separately.
end note
legend bottom
Proposed design: P-BOOK, P-INTEGRATION.
FR-004-FR-005, FR-009, FR-012; NFR-004; AC-001, AC-004-AC-006.
changeReservation is Should Have FR-020; deadline remains TBD.
BookingResult includes reservation reference or conflict / invalid / source-unavailable outcome.
endlegend
@enduml
